X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  Join Wylie House Museum for its festive <em>Ga
 rlands &amp\; Greenery Open House</em> on Saturday\, December 5\, from 10
  a.m. to 4 p.m. This free\, drop-in event invites you to experience the m
